			"notes": "## Entombed 2.0.0\n### Features\n- New command for item retrieval (#1)\n- Support for Fabric 1.21.1\n- Support for Inventorio (#2)\n- Support for Trinkets\n- Support for Accessories\n- Support for Soulbound Enchantment\n### Fixes\n- Jade tooltip now shows correct player head icon\n- Tombs can now join the End Sea in any dimension with a registered end sea in Sable\n- Blocks cannot be broken unless done so by players\n- Fixed #1 - if player died on sub-level from crushing wheel, tomb wouldn't spawn\n- Items with Curse of Vanishing vanishes on death\n- When right-clicking on a Tomb, it no longer consumes and/or places the block you would normally place\n### Changes\n- Items with Curse of Binding is now dropped on death and not forcefully equiped\n- Tomb data is now stored in the world's save file instead of the block entity"
		}
